                                                                    SITE

A personal website.


REQUIREMENTS


- A CLI Markdown-to-HTML converter (md2html).


INSTALLATION


Modify <config.mk> as needed.

The following command builds the website in-source and installs the
website's files to ROOT.

	$ make install


STRUCTURE


The <assets> directory is copied to ROOT as is.

The <src> directory contains each page's Markdown file.

The <template> directory contains files that are used to generate the
full HTML document of each page.
